---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
---

<MainLayout>
  <div class="home-container">
    <div class="intro-section">
      <div class="greeting">
        <span class="text-primary">Hello,</span><br/>
        <span class="text-primary">I'm</span> <span class="name-highlight">seeback</span> <span class="name-pronunciation">/ˈbaka/</span>
      </div>

      <div class="subtitle">
        Student / Programming Enthusiast / Lifelong Learner
      </div>

      <div class="action-buttons">
        <a href="/blog-soon" class="btn btn-primary">
          <Icons name="blog" size={16} class="btn-icon" /> Blog
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/I-who-ant" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <Icons name="github" size={16} class="btn-icon" /> GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-section">
      <div class="info-block">
        <span class="info-label">i am</span>
        <div class="info-content">
          <div>一名普通的在校大学生</div>
          <div>正在准备考研的编程爱好者</div>
          <div>热爱学习新技术和探索未知领域</div>
          <div>积极向各路技术大佬学习的小白</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-block">
        <span class="info-label">about me</span>
        <div class="info-content">
          <p>热爱编程，正在考研的路上努力前行。虽然技术水平还不够深入，但对编程充满热情，喜欢探索各种新技术。</p>

          <p>正致力于学习自己喜欢的技术栈，包括 <span class="highlight-tech">Java</span>、<span class="highlight-tech">Vue.js</span>、<span class="highlight-tech">Spring Boot</span> 等。希望通过不断学习和实践来提升自己。</p>

          <p>在学习过程中，我喜欢记录和分享自己的学习心得，向各种技术大佬们学习。除了编程，我可能🤔喜欢看技术文档，学习新知识，偶尔也会放松一下看看动漫、电影。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-block">
        <span class="info-label">find me at</span>
        <div class="social-links-grid">
          <a href="https://github.com/I-who-ant" class="social-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <Icons name="github" size={16} class="social-icon" /> GITHUB
          </a>
          <a href="https://t.me/seebacker" class="social-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <Icons name="telegram" size={16} class="social-icon" /> TELEGRAM
          </a>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
